# Passenger writes tmp/restart.txt inside the Node.js app's Application
# root (.next/standalone here) every time the app is restarted via
# cPanel's Node.js Selector -- this must stay excluded even though the
# rest of .next/standalone is deliberately un-ignored above, or every
# restart leaves the checked-out branch dirty and blocks .cpanel.yml
# deployment ("no uncommitted changes" requirement).
.next/standalone/tmp/